  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Raspberry Mocha.png|200px|left|Raspberry mocha]]\n\n{{Infobox\n|level = 46\n|price = 1 to 259\n|time = 30 min\n|xp = 31\n|source = {{Infoicon|CoffeeK|bigger|link=Coffee Kiosk}}\n|base = 72\n|dia = 3\n|time3 = 25 min\n|title = [[Products|Product]]\n}}\n'''Raspberry mocha''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 46.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making raspberry mocha'''===\n[[File:Coffee Kiosk.png|150px|left|Coffee Kiosk]]\nRaspberry mocha is made in the [[Coffee Kiosk]].\n\nTo make raspberry mocha, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Coffee Bean.png|75px|Coffee bean|link=Coffee Bean]]\n|[[File:Cream.png|75px|Cream|link=Cream]]\n|[[File:Cacao.png|75px|Cacao|link=Cacao]]\n|[[File:Raspberry.png|75px|Raspberry|link=Raspberry]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 30 minutes to make raspberry mocha, and 25 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] kiosk. Each raspberry mocha gives players 31 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling raspberry mocha'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Raspberry mocha can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,592 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 units.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make raspberry mocha costs 246 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 raspberry mocha per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Himbeer-Mokka\n|es = Moca con frambuesa\n|fr = Moka Framboise\n|it = Mocaccino ai lamponi\n|nl = Framboosmocha\n|no = Bringebær-mocca\n|zh = Raspberry Mocha\n}}\n[[pt-br:Mocha de framboesa]]\n[[ru:Малиновый мокко]]\n[[Category:Coffee Kiosk Products]]\n[[Category:Cream Products]]\n[[Category:Raspberry Products]]\n[[Category:Cacao Products]]\n[[Category:Coffee Bean Products]]",
